      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZEN MASTER (2) was held up late when beaten less than 6m at Newcastle last start and did well for third there prior. Came from wider barriers in both of those outings and is likely to get the favours from this better draw. Placed both times he has raced here and is good enough to take out a race like this. ROCKET BOY (5) has been racing well of late having finished second at his last three appearances. Came from the back row last week at Wagga and was only beaten 1.8 metres. Proven at this circuit and distance so looks well placed. CENTREFIRE (6) continued his good form when third at Bathurst last time out and won the only time he attempted this circuit and distance. JOHNNYS BLUE (1) has been coming from the back row of late so could be a big improver from the ace draw.",
